{
  "name": "SystemArchitecture",
  "internal_name": "SystemArchitecture",
  "focus": "High-level Panoptic options protocol component and flow overview: users and integrators enter through PanopticFactory, PanopticHelper, and PanopticPool; the factory clones pool and collateral implementations, initializes pool state and reward issuance, and connects to SemiFungiblePositionManager and canonical Uniswap V3 pools. Show option-position and collateral flows through PanopticPool, CollateralTracker, SFPM, and Uniswap, with shared math/types/libraries as dependencies and ERC20/ERC1155, Uniswap factory/pools, and DonorNFT as external interfaces and trust boundaries.",
